OL,3,GNEWSA'Why I bought steam fair founder's
OL,4,Asteam roller'
OL,5,
OL,6,F"I've always had a bit of a thing for
OL,7,Fsteam engines," said Clive Smith, who
OL,8,Fhas just become the proud owner of his
OL,9,Ffirst steam roller at the age of 61.
OL,11,FDespite never having driven one, Smith,
OL,12,Ffrom Child Okeford in Dorset, forked
OL,13,Fout #56,000 for the machine previously
OL,14,Fowned by the late Great Dorset Steam
OL,15,FFair founder Michael Oliver.
OL,17,FMore than 1,000 lots of steam fair
OL,18,Fmemorabilia, machinery and supplies
OL,19,Fwere sold in an auction at Lilac Farm
OL,20,Fin Bridport, marking the end of an era.
OL,23,APub: 01-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
